{room, key=hrbr_streets, name=Harbor Streets
    {attrib, output=false, tags=tested }
    {attrib, tags=navigation
        output={@
West: enter the Harbor Port
South: harbor
        }
    }

    {enter_message
        {act, logic=story, tags=!_type|room }
    }

    {story
        {message
            output={@

Buildings surround you, towering overhead.
In front of you a street glows a neon green. It travels north and south.

            }
        }
    }

    {look
        {message
            output={@

The sky overhead is dark and filled with odd-looking stars. They seem to be
square in shape and every now and then they glitch a little.

You are surrounded by buildings that reach up into the night sky. They are lit
up and billboard screens are mounted to them, showing various ads and
information.

Before you a road glows neon green. It travels north and south.

The sidewalks are filled with people. Most of them are wearing clothes that
glow along the seams or shimmer with circuit-like patterns. The fashion in
Shellspace is nothing like back home.

You hear synthesizer music coming from... somewhere.

            }
        }

        {logic, name=Harbor Streets tested, tags=!_test
            logic={@
                ?[self]((tested)) = 'true'
            }
        }
    }


    {inject, logic=/nav.inj }
    {inject, logic=/look.inj }



    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((go_west))
        {move, logic=hrbr_port, tags=[player]
            output={@

You enter the Harbor Port.

            }
        }
    }

    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((go_south))
        {set, logic=[itera]((topic)), output=harbor }
        {move, logic=harbor, tags=itera }
        {move, logic=harbor, tags=[player]
            output={@

You go south toward the harbor.

            }
        }
    }


    
    
    {dev_note, tags=Testing, active=true
        output={@
[ ] : Room
[ ] : Look
[ ] : Story

[ ] : Navigation
        }
    }
}
